#: miniworlds.worlds.hex_world.hex_world.HexWorld.view_position_ranges:3 of
msgid ""
"Positions on a hex world live in three different coordinate spaces: tiles"
" in offset coordinates `(column, row)`, corners in tripled cube "
"coordinates, and edges in doubled cube coordinates. The chunk key of the "
"tiled spatial index is derived from the raw position, so one range per "
"space is returned. Every actor whose pixel rect may intersect the camera "
"rect is covered by one of the ranges, while each range stays bounded by "
"the visible window."
msgstr ""

